# Copy to web/.env.production (or set these in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables).
# Neither is a secret: both end up in the built app.

# The free Firebase Realtime Database that shared workspaces go through (free.md, "Shared workspaces").
# Built into the website, the Windows app and the APK, so nobody has to type it to join with a code.
VITE_NIRNAYA_RELAY=https://your-project-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com

# Optional: a Nirnaya server the built app talks to by default (empty = the server that serves the page).
# VITE_API=https://nirnaya.example.com
